---
import BlogArticle from '../../components/BlogArticle.astro';

const title = 'Updated Opening Hours at Boulder Box';
const description = 'Our updated regular opening hours: closed on Mondays, open Tuesday to Sunday from 10:30 AM to 10 PM.';
---

<BlogArticle title={title} description={description} date="2026-10-19">
  <p class="excerpt">After more than a year of welcoming climbers every day, we’ve noticed that Monday is usually our quietest day.</p>

  <p>So, until further notice, we’ll be taking Mondays off and closing the gym for the day. Thanks for understanding, and for making Boulder Box part of your week. We look forward to welcoming you Tuesday through Sunday.</p>

  <h2>Our opening hours</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Monday:</strong> Closed</li>
    <li><strong>Tuesday–Sunday:</strong> 10:30 AM–10 PM</li>
  </ul>

  <p>See you on the wall!</p>
</BlogArticle>